| Imam | Imam | i-maam | إِمَام | "Mina to the Father of Imams" |
| Khumm | Khumm | khum | خُمّ | "the Messenger's life before the pool of Khumm" |
| dai | dai | daa-ee | دَاعِي | "one of the great dais of the line's middle generations" |
| duat | duat | du-aat | دُعَاة | "is superior to all duat of other islands" |
